        <mxCell id="perf-body" value="1. Meeting Analyst + Memory Agent: asyncio.gather() — run in parallel&#xa;2. Single mega-extraction LLM call (all fields in one structured JSON)&#xa;3. SSE streams first progress event within 1 sec of clicking Analyze&#xa;4. Conflict Analyst: 1 LLM call with historical context injected" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#92400E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
