        <mxCell id="flow-body" value="Upload transcript  →  POST /api/meetings  →  LangGraph triggered  →  [parallel] Meeting Analyst + Memory Agent&#xa;→  Conflict Analyst (new + historical context)  →  Impact Analysis  →  SSE streams to UI  →  Human reviews&#xa;→  Approve  →  Execution Agent writes DB (decisions approved, tasks created, project_state updated)&#xa;Copilot: any time  →  SQL + pgvector retrieval  →  LLM streaming  →  SSE token events" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1">
